#. type: Title #
#: docs/tools/ops.md:1 docs/tools/ops.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "ops ToolSet"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/ops.md:8
msgid ""
"On-demand Habitat ToolSet for **Habitat process operations**: health, "
"status, sanitized runtime config, and partner-confirmed config patch / "
"restart. Load with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/tools/ops.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "toolset_load([\"ops\"])\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/ops.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool               | Purpose                                                                                          |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `ops_health`       | Process health (`status`, `version`, `started_at`)                                               |\n"
"| `ops_status`       | Full service snapshot (memory, PG/Redis, MCP/ACP, conversation counts)                           |\n"
"| `ops_config_get`   | Runtime config with secrets masked as `***`; optional `section`                                  |\n"
"| `ops_config_patch` | Deep-merge a runtime config section; **requires `confirm: true`** after partner clarify approval |\n"
"| `ops_restart`      | Schedule Habitat restart; **requires `confirm: true`** after partner clarify approval            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/ops.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Confirm flow (writes)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/tools/ops.md:28
msgid ""
"Call ToolSet `clarify` to ask the partner whether to patch config or restart."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/tools/ops.md:28
msgid ""
"After approval, call `ops_config_patch` / `ops_restart` with `confirm: true`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/tools/ops.md:28
msgid ""
"Without `confirm: true`, the write tool returns an error (no awaiting state "
"machine inside `ops`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/ops.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Boundaries"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/ops.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Do                                                     | Do not                                                           |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Inspect status / masked config when diagnosing Habitat | Expect secrets in tool results (always `***`)                    |\n"
"| Patch non-secret runtime sections after clarify        | Patch `database` / `http` / `redis` (bootstrap; YAML cold-start) |\n"
"| Restart after clarify when a setting requires reboot   | Write MCP `env` / `headers` or secret keys via LLM tools         |\n"
"| Use Habitat settings UI / vault for credentials        | Use `ops` for cron (use ToolSet `cron`)                          |\n"
"| Read product docs via `freeanima_docs` (`ops/` prefix) | Expose this ToolSet on Habitat `/mcp`                            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/ops.md:39
msgid ""
"`ops` is **not** in the default conversation toolsets; load it when needed."
msgstr ""
